Description 	"B1-series Flame Battle Droid

Battle Droids specializing in incendiary support.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- E-60R Missile Launcher (PLX) (3)
-- Burns/pushes on det
-- 75% less damage
-- Heavyweight
- CR-24 Flame Rifle (Flamethrower)
-- 75% more damage
-- 50% slower mag reload
- Fire Grenades (3)

^6Inventory:
- Assault Sentry ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- 10% less knockback taken
- Fuel Regen (3)
- Dexterity (1)
- Getup (2)
- Elemental Resist (1)
- Blast Armor
- Armor Regen (1)
- Assemble (2)

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS2]
-- Burns/staggers on hit
-- 50% less damage

B1 battle droids were battle droids that made up the backbone of the Trade Federation Droid Army and the Separatist Droid Army. It was the successor of the hunter-killer droid."